--- Note added after this capture, not part of it ---
The verdict line above is wrong and the tool has been corrected.

Both wheel sizes arrived within half a second of FulGaz sending "start or
resume". The second one is at 148.1s because the rider restarted the ride, not
because FulGaz moved the wheel size mid-ride. The tool used to call anything
after the first minute a mid-ride change; it now compares each wheel size
against the riding app's own ride starts.

What this capture actually shows: FulGaz sets the wheel size once per ride, at
the start, and never touches it again -- 393 terrain updates and 31 minutes
without a second 0x12.
